cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this repository as a versioned conceptual working paper and research agenda. It is not peer reviewed and reports no empirical demonstration of weight-space contagion."
title: "Weight-Space Contagion: A Research Agenda for Parameter-Space Transmission, Inheritance, and Reproduction of Learned Behaviors"
type: other
authors:
  - name: "tornadofay"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-04
abstract: >-
  A conceptual research paper investigating whether a benign behavioral
  structure encoded in one neural network's parameter state can be transferred
  into a distinct recipient model's parameters, independently inherited, and
  potentially transferred onward. It distinguishes parameter-space transmission
  from model-file replication and proposes a safe experimental programme. No
  empirical demonstration is claimed.
